cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use PhyloFlask in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "PhyloFlask: a software framework for large-scale phylogenetic profile visualization"
abstract: >-
  PhyloFlask turns a BLAST tabular file into species x domain presence/absence
  matrices and, from them, an interactive Neighbour-Joining species tree
  (Jaccard distance between domain profiles), Markov-Clustering domain clusters
  with a clustering-quality validation report, heatmaps, a clustergram, a linked
  heatmap-network explorer and a 2D PCA/t-SNE embedding of domain co-occurrence.
  It ships as a Flask web application and a parallel command-line interface that
  call the same functions on the same inputs.
type: software
